{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18695","headline":"红蕉 · 柳宗元","name":"红蕉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晚英值穷节，绿润含朱光。\n以兹正阳色，窈窕凌清霜。\n远物世所重，旅人心独伤。\n回晖眺林际，摵摵无遗芳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18695.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18695","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}